\item \code{os_yrep()}: full posterior predictive draws (default, backwards-compatible)
\item \code{os_marginal()}: E(y) for hurdle models (primary inferential target)
\item \code{os_extensive()}: P(respond), the extensive margin
\item \code{os_intensive()}: E(y | respond), the intensive margin
\item \code{os_hurdle()}: all three margins in one pass
}

\strong{Draws methods:}
\itemize{
\item Descriptive: groups observed posterior predictive draws by feature columns
and applies the contrast operation (hi - lo grouping, two-way scenario classification, etc.)
\item Counterfactual: simulates posterior predictive at each grid point of \code{contrast_var},
then differences vs. baseline; produces grid-indexed results showing how contrasts
vary across the range of the contrast variable
\item Parameter: reads the draws of \code{contrast$parameter} (via \code{\link[=ppc_by_parameter]{ppc_by_parameter()}}),
